Found by k396 (fef5289). Destroy.pm _ssh_key_age_key decides whether anyone can be asked for PIN1 with a copy of OCP::ClusterKey _unlock_admin_key test (OCP::ClusterKey INTERACTIVE, else OCP::Password PINS_STDIN or -t STDIN). A public predicate in OCP::Password or OCP::ClusterKey would remove the copy, so a change to the rule cannot leave destroy behind. Lane: ocp-secrets-worker.
